[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":53},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":51,"_13":51,"_38":52},"id","basico-segunda-camada","nome","2nd layer","rascunho",false,"html","<p>The 4 middle edges are left: the ones without yellow. Each one leaves the top and goes down to the middle layer, to the right or to the left. There are two algorithms, one the mirror of the other.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;f2l&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/af67a13f03be9219.svg\" alt=\"The goal: the first two layers done. Only the top layer (in gray) is left for later.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The goal: the first two layers done. Only the top layer (in gray) is left for later.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Set up the edge</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Look on top for an edge <strong>without yellow</strong>.</li>\n<li>Turn the top (<code>U</code>) until its front color is above the center of the same color. An upside-down &quot;T&quot; forms on the front face.</li>\n<li>Look at the top color of the edge. It tells you which way the edge goes: if it is the color of the right center, it goes to the right; if it is the color of the left center, it goes to the left.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;F' U' F U R U R' U' U'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;U&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;f2l&quot;}\"><ol aria-label=\"U\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/48470d7d1e1dfdc5-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/48470d7d1e1dfdc5-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>The green and orange edge is on the right. <code>U</code> brings the green above the green center: the T forms. The orange, on top, says it goes to the right.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>To the right</h2>\n<p class=\"formula\"><code>U R U' R' U' F' U F</code></p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;F' U' F U R U R' U'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;U R U' R' U' F' U F&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;f2l&quot;}\"><ol aria-label=\"U R U' R' U' F' U F\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-5.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>F'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-6.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-7.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>F</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/5f7649820232322c-8.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>The edge goes to the right.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>Think of it in two halves: <code>U R U&#39; R&#39;</code> takes the corner out of its place, and <code>U&#39; F&#39; U F</code> brings the corner and the edge back together.</p>\n<h2>To the left</h2>\n<p class=\"formula\"><code>U' L' U L U F U' F'</code></p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;F U F' U' L' U' L U&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;U' L' U L U F U' F'&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;f2l&quot;}\"><ol aria-label=\"U' L' U L U F U' F'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>L'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>L</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-5.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>F</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-6.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-7.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>F'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7a378c865571934e-8.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>The edge goes to the left. The algorithm is the right one, mirrored.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Edge stuck in the middle</h2>\n<p>If a middle edge is in the wrong place, or flipped, and there is none on top to use: hold the cube with it at the front right and do the right algorithm. A top edge (with yellow) goes into its place, the stuck one comes up, and you do as above.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\" data-cubo=\"{&quot;cubo&quot;:&quot;3x3&quot;,&quot;embaralhar&quot;:&quot;F' U F U' R U2 R' U2 R U' R'&quot;,&quot;tira&quot;:&quot;U R U' R' U' F' U F U2 U R U' R' U' F' U F&quot;,&quot;modo&quot;:&quot;f2l&quot;}\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/39ae8f42ee357ffa.svg\" alt=\"The green and orange edge in place, but flipped. The right algorithm takes it out, `U2` brings it to the front (the T), and the right algorithm again puts it in place.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The green and orange edge in place, but flipped. The right algorithm takes it out, <code>U2</code> brings it to the front (the T), and the right algorithm again puts it in place.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>If the 1st layer comes apart</h2>\n<p>The algorithms take a white corner out of its place and bring it back at the end. If the white face ended up wrong, it was almost always a swapped move in the middle. Do it again slowly, following the strip.</p>\n","treino","/3x3/treino?grupo=basico/segunda-camada/casos","metodos",[46],"anterior",{"_13":44,"_38":45},"proximo",{"_13":42,"_38":43},"grupos",[29],{"_11":30,"_13":14,"_31":32,"_33":34,"_35":16,"_36":37,"_38":39},"Passo 3","nivel","iniciante","casos",2,"conjunto","ids",[40,41],"endereco","/3x3/basico/segunda-camada/casos","B3-Aresta-p-direita","B3-Aresta-p-esquerda","Yellow cross","/3x3/basico/cruz-amarela","1st layer","/3x3/basico/primeira-camada",{"_13":47,"_48":49,"_38":50},"Beginner method","numero",5,"/3x3/basico#segunda-camada","3x3","/3x3/",{"_54":55,"_56":57},"cubos",[60,61,62,63,64,65],"idiomas",[58,59],"pt","en",{"_11":51,"_13":51},{"_11":72,"_13":72},{"_11":71,"_13":71},{"_11":70,"_13":70},{"_11":68,"_13":69},{"_11":66,"_13":67},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","2x2"]
